.TH "Docv::DockStyle" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::DockStyle \- How the viewer\(aqs dock sits beside the page: \fB\%Regular\fR narrows the page to make room, \fB\%Overlay\fR draws over the page\(aqs left edge.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBenum Docv::DockStyle\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
How the viewer\(aqs dock sits beside the page: \fB\%Regular\fR narrows the page
to make room, \fB\%Overlay\fR draws over the page\(aqs left edge.
.SH "ENUM MEMBERS"
.PP
\fBRegular = 0\fR
.PP
\fBOverlay = 1\fR
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/docv/config.cr
